---
// rebuild/copy/21-pillar-fill-your-caseload.md. Content pillar; target:
// how to get more clients as a therapist. Body lives in
// src/content/how-to-get-more-therapy-clients.md (question-phrased H2s,
// answer-first sections, named sources, for AI search).
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Faq from '../components/site/Faq.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/site/CtaBand.astro';
import Ph from '../components/site/Ph.astro';
import { Content, getHeadings } from '../content/how-to-get-more-therapy-clients.md';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import headshot from '../assets/luke-burgett.webp';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
import { withBase } from '../lib/url';
import { rootUrl, article } from '../lib/siteSchema';

const path = '/how-to-get-more-therapy-clients';
const h1 = "How to Get More Therapy Clients: A Counselor's Guide to a Full Caseload";
const description =
  'How therapists and counselors get more clients: Google and Maps, referral partners, ethical reviews, fast follow-up, and measuring what works. Written by a licensed counselor.';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Resources', path: '/blog' }, { name: 'How to Fill Your Caseload', path }];
const takeaways = [
  'Most new therapy clients come from a handful of channels: Google search and Maps, referrals from other professionals, directories like Psychology Today, and word of mouth.',
  'A full caseload rarely comes from one channel. The practices that stay full are found, chosen, referred, and quick to reply.',
  'You can grow your reviews and referrals without breaking your ethics code. Nothing here asks a client for a review or pays for a referral.',
  'Measure new clients, not website visits. One question at intake ("How did you hear about us?") tells you what\'s working.',
];
const faqs = [
  { q: "What's the fastest way for a therapist to get clients?", a: 'Referrals from professionals who already know you, and Google Ads for your specialty and area, are usually the fastest. Search rankings take longer but keep working after you stop paying.' },
  { q: 'Should therapists use social media to get clients?', a: "It can help some practices build trust, but it isn't required. For most practices, we'd start with Google, referrals, and a clear website before social media, since those reach people who are already looking for help." },
  { q: 'How many clients should a full-time therapist see?', a: 'Many full-time counselors see 16 to 30 clients a week, and 20 is common. Because some clients come every other week or monthly, a caseload is usually larger than the weekly number. Our Caseload Calculator estimates yours.' },
  { q: 'Can I ask clients for Google reviews?', a: "Under the ACA Code of Ethics (C.3.b), counselors don't solicit testimonials from current or former clients. A passive invitation, like a waiting-room sign, lets clients choose to share without being asked." },
  { q: 'Do I need a website if I have a Psychology Today profile?', a: 'Yes, if you want channels you own. A directory profile competes with dozens of others on the same page. Your own website and Google profile work for you alone.' },
];
const toc = getHeadings().filter((h) => h.depth === 2);
const siteUrl = rootUrl(Astro.site, Astro.url);
---

<SiteLayout
  title="How to Get More Therapy Clients: A Counselor's Guide to a Full Caseload"
  description={description}
  path={path}
  crumbs={crumbs}
  faqs={faqs}
  ogType="article"
  schema={[article(siteUrl, { headline: h1, description, path, datePublished: '2026-09-30', dateModified: '2026-09-30' })]}
>
  <section class="wrap pb-10 pt-10 sm:pt-14 lg:pt-16">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8 text-sm text-muted">
      <ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
        <li><a href={withBase('/')} class="hover:text-ink">Home</a></li>
        {crumbs.map((c, i) => (
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Ph name="caret-right" class="size-3 opacity-60" />
            {i === crumbs.length - 1 ? <span aria-current="page" class="text-ink">{c.name}</span> : <a href={withBase(c.path)} class="hover:text-ink">{c.name}</a>}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-[clamp(34px,4.2vw,52px)] font-semibold leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink">{h1}</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-muted">
      <Image src={headshot} alt="Luke Burgett, LPCA" widths={[40, 80]} sizes="40px" class="size-10 rounded-full object-cover" />
      <span>
        By <a href={withBase('/about')} class="font-medium text-ink hover:text-accent">{SITE.founder}, {SITE.credential}</a> ({SITE.credentialLong}), {SITE.licenseState} · Founder, Counselor Marketing Co.<br />
        Updated <time datetime="2026-09-30">September 30, 2026</time>
      </span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[240px_1fr] lg:gap-14">
    <nav aria-label="On this page" class="hidden lg:block">
      <div class="sticky top-24">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">On this page</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 border-l border-line">
          {toc.map((t) => (
            <li><a href={`#${t.slug}`} class="-ml-px block border-l border-transparent pl-4 text-sm text-muted hover:border-accent hover:text-ink">{t.text}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <aside class="card mb-10 p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Key takeaways</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          {takeaways.map((k) => <li class="flex gap-3 text-muted"><Ph name="check" class="mt-1 size-4 text-accent" />{k}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </aside>
      <article class="prose prose-site prose-lg max-w-none">
        <Content />
      </article>
      <div class="mt-12 rounded-card bg-accent-soft p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Next step</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink/80">
          Want to know which of these steps is costing your practice clients right now? A licensed counselor reviews your practice and
          sends a written plan within 48 hours.
        </p>
        <a href={withBase(SITE.auditPath)} class="btn-primary mt-4">Get a free Caseload Audit <Ph name="arrow-right" class="size-4" /></a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[15px]">
        <span class="text-muted">Related:</span>
        <a href={withBase('/how-it-works')} class="text-accent hover:underline">How the Full Caseload System works</a>
        <a href={withBase('/therapist-website-copywriting')} class="text-accent hover:underline">Website Copy & Conversion</a>
        <a href={withBase('/google-business-profile-for-therapists')} class="text-accent hover:underline">Google Business Profile</a>
        <a href={withBase('/referral-marketing')} class="text-accent hover:underline">Referral Marketing</a>
        <a href={withBase('/caseload-calculator')} class="text-accent hover:underline">Caseload Calculator</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Faq faqs={faqs} title="Frequently asked questions" />
  <CtaBand />
</SiteLayout>
